  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing technical expert support for Local &amp; Sustainable Water Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National societies working on prevention and response to water related risks</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With 90% of disasters being water related, communities need to be able to cope with and respond to water related risks. The RC can alleviate and prevent suffering in communities by identifying and providing solutions to water related risks. Netherlands Red Cross through WAI is a major provider of technical support for water to the movement partners. This project delivers technical support to the national societies involved in the program &quot;Local and Sustainable water action&quot; sponsored by MOFA and aimed at improving localized water solutions and capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
